---
// 작업·케이스스터디 공통 목록. 페이지 없는 작업은 아래 줄 목록으로.
import MoreWork from './MoreWork.astro';
import WorkCard from './WorkCard.astro';
import { getWork, hasPage, ui, type Lang, type PortfolioSection } from '../i18n/ui';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

interface Props {
	lang: Lang;
	section: PortfolioSection;
}

const { lang, section } = Astro.props;
const t = ui[lang];
const isWork = section === 'work';
const title = isWork ? t.workTitle : t.caseStudiesTitle;
const description = isWork ? t.workIntro : t.caseStudiesIntro;
const all = await getWork(lang, section);
const work = all.filter(hasPage);
const more = all.filter((w) => !hasPage(w));
---

<BaseLayout title={`${title} | ${t.siteTitle}`} description={description} lang={lang}>
	<section class="page-header">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>{title}</h1>
			<p>{description}</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<div class="container">
		<ul class="work-list">
			{
				work.map((w) => (
					<li>
						<WorkCard lang={lang} work={w} />
					</li>
				))
			}
		</ul>
		{
			more.length > 0 && (
				<section class="more" aria-label={isWork ? t.moreWork : t.moreCaseStudies}>
					<MoreWork lang={lang} work={more} />
				</section>
			)
		}
	</div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.page-header {
		padding-top: 40px;
		text-align: center;
	}
	/* 아래 구분선: 카드와 모서리가 맞도록 콘텐츠 폭에만 */
	.page-header .container::after {
		content: '';
		display: block;
		height: 1px;
		margin-top: 40px;
		background: var(--border);
	}
	.page-header h1 {
		margin: 0 0 6px;
		font-size: 32px;
	}
	.page-header p {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--body);
		font-size: 15px;
	}

	.work-list {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 30px;
		margin: 60px 0 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
	}
	.more {
		margin-top: 80px;
	}
	@media (max-width: 767px) {
		.work-list {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
			margin-top: 40px;
		}
	}
</style>

<script>
	import '../scripts/motion';
</script>
